<title>USA: Tivoli Industries hires investment bank.</title>
<headline>Tivoli Industries hires investment bank.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tivoli Industries Inc said Tuesday it had retained New York City-based Hill Thompson Capital Markets, an investment banking firm with a specialization in mergers and acquisitions.</p>
<p>Tivoli, a maker of specialty lighting products, said Hill Thompson will assist it in finding and evaluating strategic acquisitions and provide other kinds of guidance.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
